{'symbol': 'HRL', 'date': '2019-11-11 22:30:00', 'title': 'HORMEL FOODS INTRODUCES NEW VERMONT MAPLE SPIRAL SLICED HAM', 'text': "HORMEL FOODS CORPORATION ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF ITS ALL-NEW VERMONT MAPLE SPIRAL SLICED HALF HAM, A BONE-IN, PREMIUM HAM MADE WITH REAL VERMONT MAPLE. NEW HORMEL® CURE 81® VERMONT MAPLE SPIRAL SLICED HALF HAM IS FULLY-COOKED AND PERFECT FOR THAT SPECIAL OCCASION, FAMILY GET-TOGETHER, OR HOLIDAY MEAL. HANDCRAFTED WITH THE HIGHEST STANDARDS FOR TASTE AND TEXTURE, HORMEL® CURE 81® VERMONT MAPLE SPIRAL SLICED HALF HAM COMES WITH AUTHENTIC VERMONT MAPLE FLAVOR BAKED INTO THE HAM ALONG WITH A TASTY GLAZE PACKET FOR ADDED FLAVOR AND CRUNCH. ADDITIONALLY, EACH HAM IS INDIVIDUALLY STAMPED WITH CUREMASTER'S SIGNATURE OF APPROVAL AND IS GUARANTEED TO DELIVER THE PREMIUM QUALITY, FLAVOR AND TENDERNESS HAM LOVERS DESIRE."}